OL,3,GNEWSAAccess to illegal waste dump in
OL,4,Aquarry blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court order has been put in place to
OL,7,Fprevent the dumping of illegal waste at
OL,8,Fa former quarry in West Yorkshire.
OL,10,FAccess to Calder Quarry in Elland,
OL,11,FCalderdale, has been blocked by the
OL,12,FEnvironment Agency (EA) after the order
OL,13,Fwas granted last week.
OL,15,FThe EA said it was "coming down hard"
OL,16,Fon waste crime as part of a 10-point
OL,17,Fplan.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
