OL,3,GNEWSAAccess to illegal waste dump in
OL,4,Aquarry blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency started its investigation
OL,7,Finto the site in December 2025, when
OL,8,Flocal residents reported waste tipping
OL,9,Fat the quarry with odours described as
OL,10,F"rubbish and rotting food".
